<p>Weave matter into your flesh, becoming incredibly resilient to damage.  While active you gain <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100">19, 24, 29, 32, 35</acronym> armour, <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 23%, 31%, 38%, 43%</acronym> resistance to stunning, and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 23%, 31%, 38%, 43%</acronym> resistance to cuts.</p><p>The bonus to armour will scale with your Magic.</p>